ACTUAL TODOS
- This thing does not work on Windows. The directory scanning is completely fucked because it uses dirent.h, which
  is very much not supported on Windows. If that ever gets fixed, write a wrapper around file_chck.h to change FOLD_SEP
  to '\\' instead of '/' and force -DNTHREAD and it should theoretically work on windows.

